### CheckpointStore (M1-12)

- **Android:** `com.dupbuster.scanengine.index.CheckpointStore`, `ScanRunSnapshot`, `ScanRunStatus` — persists `scan_run.last_processed_id` with monotonic checkpoints.
- **iOS:** `DBCheckpointStore`, `DBScanRunSnapshot`, `DBScanRunStatus` under `ScanEngine/Index/`.
- **API:** `beginRun` / `saveCheckpoint` / `findResumableRun` / `pauseRun` / `resumeRun` / `abandonForRestart`; rejects conflicting active runs for same `root_id` + `generation`.
