## 14. Release and store constraints

- Privacy forms: on-device processing only; no off-device unscannable reason codes in v1 telemetry.
- Permission strings: derive from `denied.blocking` + `partial.*`.
- Schema bump release notes: *"Rescan recommended — comparison rules changed in this update."*
- Prod submit: all M4 prod promote gates in `docs/implementation-plan.md` §6.2 green.

